# Picking three scattered blocks with v, copying them, clearing the selection and pasting at the end of the outline copies them in order, the first with its note.
file <<END
Work:
	- Report
		Draft due Friday
	- Slides
Home:
	- Laundry
	- Groceries
		- Milk
		- Eggs
END
keys j v j j v j j v
keys y <Esc> G p
see ▌     - Laundry
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Report
		Draft due Friday
	- Slides
Home:
	- Laundry
	- Groceries
		- Milk
		- Eggs
		- Report
			Draft due Friday
		- Slides
		- Laundry
END
